              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "favilla, favillae — \"glowing ash, embers\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ventus favillam in tēcta vīcīna ferēbat. The wind was carrying the glowing ash onto the roofs nearby."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine, mostly poetic: the hot ash that drifts and starts new fires."
            }
          ]
        },
